</td><td align="center" valign="middle" style="border-bottom:solid thin" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Open label pilot study</td><td align="center" valign="middle" style="border-bottom:solid thin" rowspan="1" colspan="1">9.57 &#x000b1; 2.75<break/>(9&#x02013;14)</td><td align="center" valign="middle" style="border-bottom:solid thin" rowspan="1" colspan="1">10</td><td align="center" valign="middle" style="border-bottom:solid thin" rowspan="1" colspan="1">10:0</td><td align="center" valign="middle" style="border-bottom:solid thin" rowspan="1" colspan="1">OCD (<italic>n</italic> = 1), ADHD (<italic>n</italic> = 3)</td><td align="center" valign="middle" style="border-bottom:solid thin" rowspan="1" colspan="1">rTMS</td><td align="center" valign="middle" style="border-bottom:solid thin" rowspan="1" colspan="1">None</td><td align="center" valign="middle" style="border-bottom:solid thin" rowspan="1" colspan="1">SMA</td><td align="center" valign="middle" style="border-bottom:solid thin" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Tic symptoms improved <underline>significantly</underline>, no improvement in ADHD, anxiety or depression.</td></tr><tr><td align="center" valign="middle" style="border-bottom:solid thin" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
