</td><td align="center" valign="middle" style="border-bottom:solid thin" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Open label</td><td align="center" valign="middle" style="border-bottom:solid thin" rowspan="1" colspan="1">10.61 &#x000b1; 2.18<break/>(7&#x02013;16)</td><td align="center" valign="middle" style="border-bottom:solid thin" rowspan="1" colspan="1">25</td><td align="center" valign="middle" style="border-bottom:solid thin" rowspan="1" colspan="1">22:3</td><td align="center" valign="middle" style="border-bottom:solid thin" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Not specified</td><td align="center" valign="middle" style="border-bottom:solid thin" rowspan="1" colspan="1">rTMS</td><td align="center" valign="middle" style="border-bottom:solid thin" rowspan="1" colspan="1">None</td><td align="center" valign="middle" style="border-bottom:solid thin" rowspan="1" colspan="1">SMA</td><td align="center" valign="middle" style="border-bottom:solid thin" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Tic severity <underline>significantly</underline> lowered, also hyperactivity, attentional deficits, depression and anxiety lower with treatment.</td></tr><tr><td colspan="10" align="center" valign="middle" style="border-bottom:solid thin" rowspan="1">
